format 1

# paradigm's registry: every tracked file type and the hk steps that check
# it (root T4). Seeded by `pklith seed --init`; edited by hand since. The
# custom rows below are shellcheck (also reads .envrc), the one-nixpkgs lock
# guard (root V20) and offline links (D11).

## checks
id|category|nix|glob|check|fix|env|msg
shellcheck|lint|shellcheck|.githooks/*, .envrc, **/*.sh|shellcheck --shell=bash {{files}}|-|-|shell script finding
flake-lock-graph|supply|jq|flake.lock|jq -e '[.nodes[] \| select(.locked.repo? == "nixpkgs")] \| length == 1' flake.lock|-|-|flake.lock holds more or fewer than one nixpkgs (root V20)
links|lint|lychee|**/*.md|git ls-files -z '*.md' \| xargs -0 lychee --offline --no-progress --include-fragments|-|-|a relative link or anchor is broken
gen-check|gate|-|-|pklith gen --check|-|-|a step in hk.pklith.pkl no longer matches .pklith; run `pklith gen`
pklith-check|gate|-|-|pklith check|-|-|a tracked file type has no row in .pklith, or a row matches nothing
no-stash|gate|gnugrep|-|! grep -nE 'stash *= *(true\|"git"\|"patch-file")' hk.pkl|-|-|hk.pkl stashes in a hook; parallel worktrees share git stash (root V15)
no-core-worktree|gate|git|-|test -z "$(git config --local --get core.worktree)"|-|-|core.worktree is set in the shared .git/config, so every worktree acts on one checkout (root V15)
names|gate|-|**/*|cargo run -q -p paradigm-dev --bin dev -- names {{files}}|-|-|a private name or an unlisted repository is staged (root V37)
coverage|coverage|sherd|**/*.rs, Cargo.toml, .coverage|sherd coverage --check|-|-|line coverage fell below the floor in .coverage (root V25)
confirm|gate|-|-|pklith confirm|-|-|the gate is incomplete, stale, unrunnable or evaluates to no steps (root V22)
actlith-gen-check|gate|-|.actlith, .github/workflows/**|actlith gen --check|actlith gen|-|a generated workflow no longer matches .actlith; run `actlith gen` (root V28)

## types
type|checks|min|exempt
*|names, no-core-worktree, trailing-whitespace, final-newline, line-endings, no-bom, no-merge-conflict, no-case-conflict, no-broken-symlinks, no-private-key, ripsecrets, typos, editorconfig-checker, no-local-paths|-|-
editorconfig|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
gitattributes|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
envrc|shellcheck|-|-
gitignore|-|-|ignore patterns, no linter reads them
Cargo.lock|-|-|written by cargo; cargo-deny reads it once a dependency policy lands
LICENSE|-|-|license text, no linter reads it
lock|flake-lock-graph|-|-
markdownlintignore|-|-|ignore patterns, no linter reads them
md|markdownlint, links|-|-
nix|nixfmt, statix, deadnix|-|-
path:**/SPEC.md|markdownlint, mth-fmt, mth-check, sherd-check, sherd-nav, sherd-budget|-|-
pklith|gen-check, pklith-check, confirm|-|-
rs|rustfmt, clippy, coverage|-|-
pkl|no-stash|-|-
path:.actlith|actlith-gen-check|-|-
path:.github/workflows/*.yml|actlith-gen-check|-|-
context-limits|sherd-budget|-|-
coverage|coverage|-|-
commit-msg|shellcheck|-|-
pre-commit|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
pre-push|-|-|written by pklith (seed or gen)
toml|taplo|-|-
yaml|yamllint|-|-
